        <strong>Quick answer:</strong> To import wire mesh from China successfully: (1) define your full technical specification—material grade, mesh count, wire diameter, weave type, dimensions, and tolerances; (2) source 3–5 factories from the Anping wire mesh cluster via B2B platforms or a <a href="/factories/" class="text-theme-primary underline">verified factory directory</a>; (3) verify each supplier's business license and mill certificates; (4) order samples before committing; (5) negotiate on FOB terms using a <a href="/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-primary underline">FOB price calculator</a> to know your true landed cost; (6) pay 30% deposit by T/T and the balance after pre-shipment inspection; (7) book shipping with a freight forwarder and plan container loading with a <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-primary underline">loading calculator</a>. Total timeline: 30–60 days from first inquiry to goods in hand.
      </p>
